%% Figure: KAI grounded question-answering (retrieval over synced data)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Dashboard (Ask KAI tab)
    participant KAI as *-kai-ask edge function
    participant DB as Supabase DB (synced tables)
    participant GW as Lovable AI Gateway (Gemini 3 Flash)

    User->>UI: ask a question (natural language)
    UI->>KAI: invoke (startup_id, question)
    KAI->>DB: read full synced history<br/>(daily roll-ups, registry, open PRs)
    DB-->>KAI: rows
    KAI->>KAI: buildSnapshot()<br/>aggregate people / repos / totals / momentum
    KAI->>GW: system prompt (grounding rules + JSON snapshot) + question
    GW-->>KAI: grounded answer (markdown)
    Note over KAI,GW: 429 -> rate-limited message<br/>402 -> credits-exhausted message
    KAI-->>UI: { ok, answer }
    UI-->>User: rendered answer
